    <string name="about_title">About TempoPulse</string>
    <string name="about_subtitle">A precise metronome for practice and stage</string>
    <string name="about_body">TempoPulse uses a directly synthesised, low-latency audio engine so every beat stays stable and clear.\n\n• 20–300 BPM with wheel drag and tap tempo\n• 15 meters with per-beat accent or mute\n• Quarter, eighth, triplet and sixteenth subdivisions\n• 6 synthesised sounds and background playback\n• Tempo presets, light / dark themes and accent colours\n\nEverything stays on this device. The app has no network access, collects no data and contains no ads.</string>
